1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,700
Siapa korang yang nak TURUN ANGKA?

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,500
Tapi ada masalah...

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,450
SELALU CRAVING!

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,880
Ini gula-gula SCC

5
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,000
yang boleh bantu korang

6
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,320
POTONG CRAVING korang!

7
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,320
