10
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,460
Ini TESTIMONI sebenar

11
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,040
orang yang DAH BERJAYA!

12
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,420
Tengok testimoni orang

13
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,640
